name semlink-pb-vn
# instances/pb-vn2.json: SemLink's mapping of PropBank rolesets to VerbNet classes, an object whose keys are rolesets
# (abandon.01), each an object whose keys are the class numbers it maps to (51.2), each an object of the roleset's
# arguments (ARG0) and the thematic role each is in the class (theme):
#   {"abandon.01": {"51.2": {"ARG0": "theme"}}, ...}
# A mapping is the pair of the roleset and the class, each the type its key names, and SemLink says it; what it says
# of an argument it says within the mapping, [[abandon.01, 51.2], ARG0, theme]. The highway maps the roleset to the
# class.
match pb-vn2.json
format json
levels roleset class argument

thing roleset key
thing class ^roleset/key key
type roleset.key pbroleset
type class.key vnclass
content argument.key value

itself class
# an argument's key is a PropBank argument (ARG0), its value the VerbNet role: the source's own correspondence
value - argument.key
relate argument key to value

maps class ^roleset/key pbroleset to key vnclass
